<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><id>https://inews.hket.com/sran001/%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8?mtc=20080</id><title>HKET News Feed</title><updated>2026-03-16T04:35:53.437964+08:00</updated><link href="https://inews.hket.com/sran001/%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8?mtc=20080"/><generator uri="https://lkiesow.github.io/python-feedgen" version="1.0.0">python-feedgen</generator><subtitle>Latest news</subtitle><entry><id>https://ps.hket.com/article/4098647/%E7%BE%8E%E8%81%AF%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B0%E7%9B%A4%E7%86%B1%E8%B3%A3%20%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B%E4%BA%A4%E6%8A%95%E5%8F%97%E6%83%A0%20%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%AB%E5%8D%81%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%8B%E8%8B%91%E9%8C%8412%E5%AE%97%E6%88%90%E4%BA%A4%20%E6%8C%89%E5%91%A8%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%871%E5%80%8D?mtc=20023</id><title>美聯：新盤熱賣 二手交投受惠 周末十大屋苑錄12宗成交 按周大升1倍</title><updated>2026-03-16T20:50:00+08:00</updated><content type="html"/><link href="https://ps.hket.com/article/4098647/%E7%BE%8E%E8%81%AF%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B0%E7%9B%A4%E7%86%B1%E8%B3%A3%20%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B%E4%BA%A4%E6%8A%95%E5%8F%97%E6%83%A0%20%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%AB%E5%8D%81%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%8B%E8%8B%91%E9%8C%8412%E5%AE%97%E6%88%90%E4%BA%A4%20%E6%8C%89%E5%91%A8%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%871%E5%80%8D?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-03-16T20:50:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://specialist.hket.com/article/4098387/%E5%85%A9%E6%9C%83%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%20%E4%B8%AD%E6%B3%B0%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%99%E9%9B%BB%E5%8A%9B%E8%A8%AD%E5%82%99%E8%82%A1%E4%BC%B0%E5%80%BC%E4%BB%B2%E6%9C%89%E5%BE%97%E5%8D%87?mtc=20023</id><title>兩會政策支持概念 中泰國際：這電力設備股估值仲有得升</title><updated>2026-03-16T00:59:00+08:00</updated><content type="html">

&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-03-16T00:59:26+08:00 Updated on: 2026-03-16T00:59:29.168+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;兩會於周四（12日）完滿結束。期間，全國政協委員、國網上海電力公司二級顧問阮前途表示，「十五五」時期將是中國能源革命與新型電力系統建設的重要階段。超大城市在經濟社會發展中作用突出，需進一步推進其新型電力系統建設，協同完善新型能源體系基建。其中，威勝控股				&lt;a class="inline-related-stock" href="https://invest.hket.com/data/HKG03393/?mtc=h0023"&gt;（03393）&lt;/a&gt;
具備分拆概念、納入港股通概念，且剛發佈盈喜，值得逢低吸納。&lt;/p&gt;
